{
 "name": "Contraptions 15: Hilbert track (order 3, trap) (Momentum Bubbles 13)",
 "description": "A Hilbert-curve track (order 3, 60 gates, each aiming at the next) at 512\u00b2: 3 dots (radius 14 cells) start at rest in every other gate from the first, which launch them along the curve into a trap in place of its last 2x2 block, in the bottom-right corner (Momentum Bubbles 13): a smooth round hill, fading out before the frame's edges, that brakes whatever is in it and draws it in, senses how full it is, and once full (about 0.45 of it) lets go, launching what it collected east, round the frame toward the first gates. Gates: brake, accel 0.002, aim_speed 0.025. Gates show as the aim channel, the trap as trap and full, in the custom palette.",
